2738	   *      `WORKER_CONCURRENCY - active.size` is how many new jobs may be
2739	   *      claimed this tick. A slow job (e.g. a 20-minute PROVISION) just
2740	   *      occupies one entry in this map for a long time; it never prevents
2741	   *      other entries from being added/removed, so unrelated jobs are never
2742	   *      blocked by it (requirement: a stuck job must not steal others'
2743	   *      slots).
