2747	   *      same serverId. This is what stops a PROVISION and a later DELETE
2748	   *      for the same server from ever running concurrently or out of order:
2749	   *      the DELETE simply stays QUEUED (re-checked every tick) until the
2750	   *      PROVISION's promise settles and its entry is removed.
